## 7. Non-negotiables — confirmed preserved

- **Storage read leak stays closed.** Presigned URLs are write-only `UploadPart` URLs for one uploadId. S3 keys never leave the Edge Function. Reads still go exclusively through `sign-media`. One addition: because the S3 layer writes with service credentials, `storage.objects.owner` will not be the coach — make sure nothing (RLS, cleanup jobs) relies on it.
- **No silent quality trade.** The master is uploaded byte-for-byte. §5.1 is flagged for a human decision.
- **Web stays on tus-js-client.** Untouched.

